# Never put transport scripts, local artifacts, caches/logs, or credentials
# into a *whole examples tree* build context. Normal versioned-image builds use
# only one image's three-file context, defined by examples/Makefile. Keep .sqsh
# assets available for builds that intentionally copy them (for example the vLLM M2 image).
.dockerignore
**/scripts/
**/image-archive/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.log
commands.txt
